# Plaits Lab contributor packages under packages/community/ ARE tracked here,
# unlike the upstream SDK default, which ignores them because a package is
# submitted as a zip via `plaits-lab submit`. We keep one model per branch off
# models/base, which only works if the source is under version control.
#
# Their rendered previews are not: those are build artifacts, regenerated by
# `plaits-lab render`, and a few seconds of 48 kHz stereo runs to megabytes.
alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_sdk/packages/*/*/previews/

# Per-machine toolchain. The activation script and its notes are shared, so that
# a fresh branch can set up a shell without rediscovering which compiler works;
# anything unpacked beside them is a few hundred MB of local binaries and is not.
alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_sdk/.toolchain/*
!alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_sdk/.toolchain/activate.ps1
!alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_sdk/.toolchain/README.md
